    "prompt": "Let $A$ be a subset of $\\mathbb R$. Define the following.\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\max A&=x\\in A\\text{ where }x\\ge a\\text{ for any }a\\in A\\\\\\min A&=x\\in A\\text{ where }x\\le a\\text{ for any }a\\in A\\end{aligned}$$\nFind $\\min\\{-4,9,-9,8\\}$.",
